# .gitignore — Psychiatry Clerkship Library
# Principle: version the CURATED TEXT source of truth (markdown, html, build scripts, JSON config).
# Keep large binaries and generated build output OUT of git so the repo stays lean and diffable.
# Anything ignored here still lives on disk — it is just not version-controlled. Use Git LFS if you
# later want the media/decks versioned.

# ---- OS / editor junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ---- Node (future-proof) ----
node_modules/

# ---- Generated build output ----
# The two deployed sites are BUILD ARTIFACTS produced by 13_Faculty_Resources/_automation/site_build/
# and live as SIBLING folders outside this repo (../clerkship-hub-deploy, ../mmc-resident-deploy).
# They are intentionally not tracked here — source is truth, deploy is generated.
/_build/
/_dist/

# ---- Large binary assets (originals; use Git LFS or external storage if you need them versioned) ----
# Audio / video
# NOTE: mp3/m4a/wav/mp4 are Git LFS-tracked (site deploy assets) — see .gitattributes + GIT_AND_DEPLOY_PLAN.md §6.
# *.mp3   -> LFS
# *.m4a   -> LFS
# *.wav   -> LFS
# *.mp4   -> LFS
*.m4v
*.aac
*.flac
*.mov
# Reference documents & slide decks (originals live under **/_source/ and download folders)
*.pdf
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.doc
*.docx
*.key

# ---- Bulk downloads & large data artifacts ----
13_Faculty_Resources/APA_Downloads_2026-06-29/files/
00_START_HERE/_audit-census-codex/data/

# ---- Netlify CLI local state (never commit; per-site config lives in the Netlify UI) ----
.netlify/

# ---- Scratch ----
*.tmp
*.bak
